  "name": "@kentico/management-api-mcp",
  "readme": "# Xperience by Kentico - Management API MCP server\r\n\r\nThis package provides a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that allows AI tools to work with the Xperience by Kentico management API.\r\n\r\n## Documentation\r\n\r\nFor setup instructions and usage guidelines, refer to the official Xperience by Kentico documentation:\r\n[Content type management API](https://docs.kentico.com/x/management_api_xp)\r\n\r\n## License\r\n\r\nSee LICENSE.txt for license information.",
  "readmeFilename": "README.md",
